{"title":"Career Roadmap · Electronics Technician","role":"Electronics Technician","summary":"An Electronics Technician installs, tests, troubleshoots, repairs, calibrates and maintains electronic circuits, equipment and systems.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science - General / Honours)","Course":"Electronics"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Electronics Technician installs, tests, troubleshoots, repairs, calibrates and maintains electronic circuits, equipment and systems."},{"type":"p","text":"A B.Sc Electronics graduate can work across:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Electronic circuit testing and troubleshooting"},{"text":"PCB assembly and testing"},{"text":"Embedded systems and microcontrollers"},{"text":"Industrial electronics"},{"text":"Instrumentation and control"},{"text":"Consumer electronics"},{"text":"Telecommunications equipment"},{"text":"Power electronics"},{"text":"Automotive electronics"},{"text":"IoT devices"},{"text":"Electronics manufacturing and quality testing"},{"text":"Field service and maintenance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile is not simply “B.Sc Electronics graduate”, but:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Electronics","Circuit Troubleshooting","Testing & Measurement","PCB","Embedded Systems","Microcontrollers","Documentation","Basic Automation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Career Flow"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Electronics","Physics + Mathematics + Electronics Fundamentals","Analog + Digital Electronics","Circuit Analysis + Electronic Measurements","Soldering + PCB + Testing Equipment","Microcontrollers + Embedded Programming","Sensors + Communication Interfaces","Troubleshooting + Preventive Maintenance","Industrial/Embedded Electronics Internship","Electronics Technician","Senior Electronics Technician","Electronics Test / Service / Maintenance Specialist","Senior Technical Speci