 Skill Stack"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"B.Sc Electronics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Circuit Analysis"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Analog Electronics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Digital Electronics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Electronic Measurements"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Multimeter + Oscilloscope"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Soldering + PCB"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Circuit Simulation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Microcontrollers"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Embedded C"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Sensors"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"UART / SPI / I²C"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Troubleshooting"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Testing & Quality"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Technical Documentation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Basic Python / Automation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Industrial / IoT Awareness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Read electronic schematics"},{"text":"Identify electronic components"},{"text":"Build basic analog and digital circuits"},{"text":"Use a multimeter confidently"},{"text":"Analyze basic oscilloscope waveforms"},{"text":"Solder and desolder components"},{"text":"Diagnose common PCB faults"},{"text":"Design basic PCBs"},{"text":"Simulate circuits"},{"text":"Program a microcontroller"},{"text":"Interface sensors"},{"text":"Use UART, SPI and I²C"},{"text":"Perform functional testing"},{"text":"Document test procedures and results"},{"text":"Follow electronics safety procedures"},{"text":"Build at least 3–5 practical electronics projects"},{"text":"Complete at least one industry-oriented internship"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, B.Sc Electronics alone is not enough to differentiate the candidate strongly."},{"type":"p","text":"The better positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Electronics","Practical Electronics Testing","PCB","Troubleshooting","Embedded Systems","Microcontrollers","Instrumentation","Industry Intern